        <!-- About Section -->
        <section id="about" class="about section">

            <!-- Section Title -->
            <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
                <h2>About Us<br></h2>
                <p><span>Learn More</span> <span class="description-title">About Us</span></p>
            </div><!-- End Section Title -->

            <div class="container">

                <div class="row gy-4">
                    <div class="col-lg-7" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <img src="~/yummy-red-1.0.0/assets/img/about.jpg" class="img-fluid mb-4" alt="">
                        <div class="book-a-table">
                            <h3>For Reservation</h3>
                            <p>+1 5589 55488 55</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
                        <div class="content ps-0 ps-lg-5">
                            <p class="fst-italic">
                                Located in the heart of the city, Sunny Corner offers a unique dining experience where modern flavors meet a cozy atmosphere. Whether you're here for a hearty breakfast, a delightful lunch, or a memorable dinner, our carefully crafted menu caters to every taste. With themed nights like Game Night and Birthday Celebrations, we create moments worth sharing. Our friendly staff and vibrant interior ensure that every visit is not just a meal, but an experience to remember.
                            </p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> <span>Weekend Breakfast Special: Enjoy a 20% discount on breakfast every Saturday and Sunday.</span></li>
                                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> <span>Birthday Surprise: Receive a complimentary dessert and special table decoration on your birthday</span></li>
                                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> <span>Game Night Special: Win surprise gifts during our game nights every Thursday evening.</span></li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>
                                "Since opening its doors in 2010, Sunny Corner has been a beloved hangout for friends and families. With a cozy atmosphere, delicious food, and friendly service, it has grown over the years while keeping its welcoming spirit alive."
                            </p>

                            <div class="position-relative mt-4">
                                <img src="~/yummy-red-1.0.0/assets/img/about-2.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="">
                                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7f98aduVJ8" class="glightbox pulsating-play-btn"></a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section><!-- /About Section -->
        <!-- Why Us Section -->
        <section id="why-us" class="why-us section light-background">

            <div class="container">

                <div class="row gy-4">

                    <div class="col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <div class="why-box">
                            <h3>Why Choose Sunny Corner</h3>
                            <p>
                                Sunny Corner is more than a place to eat – it’s a vibrant experience. Enjoy a cozy, lively atmosphere, a menu blending traditional flavors with modern twists, and exceptional service. Make every visit memorable and part of our sunny community.
                            </p>
                            <div class="text-center">
                                <a href="#" class="more-btn"><span>Learn More</span> <i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div><!-- End Why Box -->

