                                    <i class="bi bi-clipboard-data"></i>
                                    <h4>
                                        Weekly Reservations at Sunny Corner
                                    </h4>
                                    <p>Sunny Corner receives an average of 120 reservations per week. Weekends are the busiest, with most slots fully booked. These numbers reflect our guests’ trust and satisfaction.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div><!-- End Icon Box -->

                            <div class="col-xl-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
