                                    <h4>
                                        VIP Guests at Sunny Corner
                                    </h4>
                                    <p>Sunny Corner hosts around 25 VIP guests each week. These guests enjoy personalized services and exclusive perks. Their loyalty highlights our commitment to exceptional experiences.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div><!-- End Icon Box -->

